{"id":"20.02.Balls","contentHtml":"<p>This project is my personal sprint at <strong>Global Game Jam 2020</strong> (theme \"Repair\"). After the team's main game was ready, I decided to test my strength in extreme conditions.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>Challenge</h2>\n<p>This project was a <strong>personal challenge of endurance and speed</strong>. I set myself a goal: <mark>to create a second, fully playable game from scratch alone in one remaining night</mark>.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>Engineering Solution</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Core Mechanics:</strong> Implemented a full game loop: a bus moves along a <strong>fragmented road floating in the sky</strong>. The player's task is to \"repair\" the path in time by <strong>inflating the necessary balloons to align the road segments</strong> in front of the bus. Speed increases over time, increasing difficulty.</li>\n<li><strong>Ultra-Fast Prototyping:</strong> <mark>The entire development cycle — from idea to finished build — was completed in one night</mark>. This included programming, physics setup, and creating part of the 3D assets (roads, ground) in <code>Blender</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>Outcome</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Goal Achieved:</strong> In one night, a <strong>fully playable prototype</strong> was created from scratch, and our team presented two games to the jury instead of one.</li>\n<li><strong>Demonstration of \"Fighting\" Qualities:</strong> The project proves my ability for <mark>ultra-fast prototyping</mark>, dedication, and the ability to see a product through to the end under extreme conditions.</li>\n<li><strong>Creativity Under Pressure:</strong> Successfully found and implemented a non-trivial interpretation of the hackathon theme.</li>\n</ul>\n","published":true,"title":"Balls","date":"2020-02","type":"project","tagsArray":["Hackathon","PC","Unity","C#","Blender"],"heroVideo":["NgfVH3FMdx8"],"shortDescription":"<p>Personal challenge at Global Game Jam: <mark>created this second game from scratch in one night</mark> after completing the team's main project.</p>\n","storeLinks":["https://v3.globalgamejam.org/2020/games/chelyabinsk-2077-4"],"role":"solo","projectIcon":"/images/projects/20.02.Balls/icon.webp","cardBackground":"/images/projects/20.02.Balls/card.mp4?v=1765046991693","screenshots":[{"src":"/images/projects/20.02.Balls/screenshots/1.webp","width":1080,"height":719},{"src":"/images/projects/20.02.Balls/screenshots/2.webp","width":1080,"height":719}]}